  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0458.daidalos.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0458.daidalos.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0458.daidalos.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0458_daidalos"><head>ΔΑΙΔΑΛΟΣ</head><pb n="216" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044079388682:scan:226" />
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0458-daidalos-1">
              <head>I.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0458-daidalos-1-l1">Ἐθέλει δ᾽ ἄνευ</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0458-daidalos-1-l2">μισθοῦ παρ᾿ αὐτοῖς καταμένειν ἐπισίτιος.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus VI p. 247 a. de voce ἐπισίτιος agens: Εὔβουλος δ᾽ ἐν Δαιδάλῳ Ἐθέλει κτλ.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0458-daidalos-2">
              <head>II.</head>
              <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 108 14: <quote>μήχι</quote>, ὡς ναίχι καὶ οὐχί. Εὔβουλος Δαιδάλῳ.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0458-daidalos-3">
              <head>III.</head>
              <note type="source">Themistius ad Aristot. de Anim. I 3: <quote>Δημόκριτος παραπλησίως λέγων Φιλίππῳ τῷ κωμῳδοδιδασκάλῳ· φησὶ γὰρ τὸν Δαίδαλον κινουμένην ποιῆσαι τὴν ξυλίνην Ἀφροδίτην ἐγχέαντα ἄργυρον χυτόν.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">V. Hist. crit. p. 342. 360. Philippi sive Eubuli versus fortasse fuit hic: <quote>
                  <lg>
                    <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0458-daidalos-3-l1">ξυλίνην Ἀφροδίτην ἐγχέας χυτὸν ἄργυρον.</l>
                  </lg>
                </quote>
              </note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>